{"title": "Unarmed Strike", "pageid": 3926, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unarmed_Strike", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Melee unarmed attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Bugs", "Common actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Unarmed_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Unarmed_Strike.webp/300px-Unarmed_Strike.webp, /w/images/0/03/Unarmed_Strike.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Unarmed_Strike.webp/300px-Unarmed_Strike.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Unarmed_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Unarmed Strike</b> is a common <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> which allows the user to make an attack with their bare fists when no melee weapons are equipped.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nHit a target with your bare fists.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1 + <a href=\"/wiki/Strength#Strength_modifier_chart\" title=\"Strength\">Strength modifier</a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Unarmed Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Unarmed <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" title=\"Tavern Brawler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/20px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/30px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/40px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tavern Brawler\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp/20px-Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Tavern_Brawler_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tavern_Brawler\" title=\"Tavern Brawler\">Tavern Brawler</a> adds the attacker's Strength modifier to the attack roll and damage a second time.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk's</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Deft_Strikes\" title=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/20px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/30px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/20px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Deft_Strikes\" title=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\">Martial Arts: Deft Strikes</a> replaces the 1 base damage of an Unarmed Strike with 1d4. This increases to 1d6 at monk level 3 and 1d8 at monk level 9.</li>\n<li>Monk's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Dextrous_Attacks\" title=\"Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/20px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/30px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/20px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Dextrous_Attacks\" title=\"Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks\">Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks</a> may replace the Strength modifier normally added to the damage of Unarmed Strikes with the Dexterity modifier if it is higher. In either case, the bonus damage from Tavern Brawler always uses the Strength modifier.</li>\n<li>Many buffs and features which specify that they apply to \"weapon attacks\", such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a>, do not apply to Unarmed Strikes.</li>\n<li>For a comprehensive list of effects that interact with Unarmed Strikes, see: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_features_and_items_that_interact_with_unarmed_strikes\" title=\"List of features and items that interact with unarmed strikes\">List of features and items that interact with unarmed strikes</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Items and features that add a damage roll to Unarmed Strikes without <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">monk's</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Deft_Strikes\" title=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/20px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/30px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/20px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Deft_Strikes\" title=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\">Martial Arts: Deft Strikes</a> cause the damage tooltip to display as <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\">0d20 + <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier + the additional bonus damage</span>. The base Bludgeoning damage is still dealt correctly.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/2/21/A-Fists_of_Fury.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/A-Fists_of_Fury.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Fists of Fury</dt>\n<dd>Kill a character with an Unarmed Strike.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3147/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39170/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18265/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1317632/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.058      1 -total\n 99.24%   60.592      1 Template:Feature_page\n 76.07%   46.446     35 Template:Trim\n 31.81%   19.421      4 Template:SmPass\n 21.72%   13.262      8 Template:Icon_text\n 18.13%   11.071      6 Template:Icon_link\n 14.05%    8.578      1 Template:R\n 10.69%    6.527      4 Template:Passive_inline/format\n  8.94%    5.457      5 Template:Main_name